sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 Utilisateur
    participant Frontend as 🖥️ Frontend (React)
    participant GW as 🔀 API Gateway
    participant US as 👤 Users Service
    participant KC as 🔐 Keycloak

    User->>Frontend: Saisit email + mot de passe
    Frontend->>GW: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    GW->>US: POST /api/auth/login
    US->>KC: POST /token {username, password, client_id}
    KC->>KC: Vérification des credentials
    alt Credentials valides
        KC-->>US: Access Token (JWT) + Refresh Token
        US-->>GW: LoginResponse {accessToken, refreshToken}
        GW-->>Frontend: 200 OK {accessToken, refreshToken}
        Frontend->>Frontend: Stocker les tokens (mémoire)
        User->>Frontend: Accède aux ressources protégées
        Frontend->>GW: GET /api/events (Bearer: accessToken)
        GW->>KC: Valider JWT (introspection)
        KC-->>GW: Token valide + rôles
        GW->>GW: Router la requête selon les rôles
        GW-->>Frontend: 200 OK + Données
    else Credentials invalides
        KC-->>US: 401 Unauthorized
        US-->>GW: 401 Unauthorized
        GW-->>Frontend: 401 {message: "Invalid credentials"}
        Frontend->>User: Afficher erreur de connexion
    end

    Note over Frontend, KC: Rafraîchissement du token
    Frontend->>GW: POST /api/auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    GW->>US: POST /api/auth/refresh
    US->>KC: POST /token {grant_type: refresh_token}
    KC-->>US: Nouveau Access Token
    US-->>GW: LoginResponse {newAccessToken}
    GW-->>Frontend: 200 OK {newAccessToken}
